-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Attribution
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This site is built on the Dinky theme for GitHub Pages:

  https://github.com/pages-themes/dinky

Dinky is dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal, which asks for
no attribution. It is credited here anyway, because the site is a genuine
derivative rather than a mere consumer of the theme: _layouts/default.html
began as a copy of Dinky's own layout, and assets/css/style.scss imports
Dinky's stylesheet and restates a number of its rules on top of it.

Both typefaces are under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, and both are
redistributed by this repository as subsets, so the OFL's requirement that the
licence travel with the font applies to each:

  Inter, by Rasmus Andersson -- body copy.
    assets/fonts/inter-latin-var.woff2, licence at assets/fonts/Inter-OFL.txt

  Arvo, by Anton Koovit -- headings.
    assets/fonts/arvo-400.woff2 and arvo-700.woff2,
    licence at assets/fonts/Arvo-OFL.txt

Both files are derivatives of the upstream fonts rather than copies. Inter's
weight axis is clamped to 400-700 and its optical-size axis pinned; both are cut
to a character set of latin plus Latin Extended-A and punctuation. The exact
commands are recorded in assets/css/style.scss, so each derivation is
reproducible from the upstream release.

Dinky's own stylesheet still @imports Arvo's stylesheet from Google Fonts, which
is a 0.8 KB request this repository cannot remove without giving up importing
Dinky at all. It returns font-face declarations only; the declarations in
assets/css/style.scss come later and win, so no font file is fetched from
Google.
